      "writtenOn": "2018-10-12T13:34:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We will want these i2c0 lines defined as gpios as well. This allows the i2c_master.c to control the i2c lines as gpio to unstick the i2c bus when needed. Even though we define them as GPIO here, there will use the alternate mode (of i2c) most of the time.",
      "revId": "3384ce12f332898899d1fb9a21729ee42bb13935",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
